  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(2.05 times 2.05 - 3.23 times 3.23)/(2.05 + 3.23)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\na² - b² = (a + b)(a - b)\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ (2.05² - 3.23²)/(2.05 + 3.23)\n\n⇒ ((2.05 + 3.23) times (2.05 - 3.23))/((2.05 + 3.23))\n\n⇒ 2.05 - 3.23\n\n⇒ -1.18\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (2).**",
